Parole violation: assault arising from a family dispute.

57
00:03:23,750 --> 00:03:25,240
We won't be here. They'll see him.

58
00:03:35,390 --> 00:03:36,380
Quit whining!

59
00:03:36,530 --> 00:03:37,750
Quit whining all the time! It makes me sick!

60
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:40,220
Shut up!

61
